		<DeletedComponentTemplates />
		<Id>9100</Id>
		<Name>Windows UDP Ephemeral Port Exhaustion</Name>
		<IsMockTemplate>false</IsMockTemplate>
		<Description>Watches the UDP dynamic port range on a Windows host: percent of the range in use and the processes holding it (PowerShell over WinRM), plus the native UDPv4 and TCPv4 counters that show a burst as it happens. Pair with a Windows Event Log component for System / Tcpip / 4266, added in the console; see docs/modules/sam-udp-port-exhaustion-template.md.</Description>
